       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "// ✨ Quality Of Life",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "✅ Vulf's convo during the Titans' Tomb boss fight is now skippable (you're welcome, speedrunners)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "✅ Added a \"Refund All\" button to Scarf Loom (Hold Alt / Y / Triangle) to quickly reset all to 0.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "✅ Better visual clarity for the Bubble meter on side of Caf",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "✅ Added tip text to \"use BUBBLE to block!\" in first boss fight",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "// 🐛 Bug fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "✅ Fixed a rare crash when restarting zone",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "And a special thanks to anybody reporting issues, I'm doing my best to squash any and every bug! Keep 'em coming here if you spot any more issues:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cheers,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Andrew // @FermenterGames",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
